Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:24.85,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}中岛布兰登 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}10-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}7{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 门西克 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Brandon, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,布兰登 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,What a roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,真是过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Great start and then things got a little tight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局很好 后来打得有点紧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我们讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean first match at Laver Cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 第一次打拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,obviously some nerves coming out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,it's pretty normal and eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这很正常 后来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,when I lost the second set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,丢掉第二盘的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,just try to tell myself to fight for every point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,就告诉自己每一分都要拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, trust the guys on the bench,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,相信板凳上的队友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,trust myself, and, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,相信自己 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.04,EN,,0,0,0,,really happy with the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢了真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,the guys on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,板凳上的队友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about that for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们就聊聊这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,because you don't get to play a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你平时很少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of team events and there are guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,打团体赛 而队里有人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that have been here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前来过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,before, but this is your debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这是你的首秀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.28,EN,,0,0,0,,What's it like having that input?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,听他们出主意是什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you like that or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你喜欢还是不喜欢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's great just to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得很棒 能听听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,their thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,they're all great tennis players,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们都是很出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,so very interesting to hear their thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以听他们怎么看很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,on the match, how I'm playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么看这场球 看我打得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's also nice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且也很好的是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to have some veterans out here that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,队里有几位老将
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that played Laver Cup a few times,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,打过好几届拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,so definitely good to have all the guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以有全队在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.60,EN,,0,0,0,,What about we bring over the veteran
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,要不把老将请过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and the legend in Andre Agassi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,传奇阿加西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Everybody, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Don't go. Brandon, now Andre,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,别走 布兰登 现在问安德烈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,at one point he goes up 3-0
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一阵他第一盘3比0领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first set and he goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时想的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I got nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没什么可说的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But then you had to try to do some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但后来你得干点活了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错 毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,when you get off to a great start,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局打得好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,there's no scoreboard pressure sort
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,球网两边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of on both sides of the net
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,都没有比分压力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and everybody's kind of free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都能放开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to do their thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,打自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Second set, Mensik gets up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘 门西克早早领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,They both, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个人 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,he's just started letting it fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,他开始放开抡了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,but then it quickly turns into a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但很快就变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,满满的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And that's where I bet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种时候我每次都
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:27.92,EN,,0,0,0,,on this guy every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:27.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,押这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's rock solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,他稳得像块石头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Welcome. You're initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,欢迎你 你正式入队了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And it was such an important point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一分太重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, the first two matches of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天前两场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,the first one could have gone your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一场你们本来可能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果没赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And you have to absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们得消化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,那份失望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,No, no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错 毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you definitely want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当然希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to get off to a good start,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,开个好头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but ultimately you're looking at this like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但归根结底你会这么看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,if you know, some go their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的归他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,some go our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的归我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:49.60,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll call it even. Intensity builds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算扯平吧 越来越激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,is one reason why this weekend's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这正是这个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么好玩的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And what about as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那进入
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,into the evening session?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,晚场呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You've got Alexander Bublik coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们派出的是布勃利克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So you got some different work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得做的功课就不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Very different personality to Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,和布兰登性格很不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,this guy's like I'm not convinced he's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这家伙 我都不信他是真人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I think he's AI, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得他是AI 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,He just goes about his business like point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,他就是闷头打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,after point after point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,一分接一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Bublik brings a lot of weapons to the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,布勃利克手里武器很多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So let's hope
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that things fall our way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果还能站在我们这边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know, you know, we're away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过 我们是客队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,so I'm not going to say too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就不多说了
